# Testing Rules

- Write unit tests for all new components, functions, and API endpoints.
- Use Jest for unit testing.
- For frontend, use React Testing Library for component testing.
- For backend, use Supertest for API testing.
- Ensure tests cover happy paths, edge cases, and error scenarios.
- Keep tests fast, reliable, and well-organized.